      "post_id": "2095227633848008947",
      "url": "https://x.com/GGaborGiran/status/2095227633848008947",
      "text": "Temu spends more to get you than it makes from you.\n\nFree shipping. Free returns. $0.80 phone cases. Ads during the Super Bowl.\n\nThat's customer acquisition cost, and right now theirs is higher than anything you'll ever spend there.\n\nThe bet is simple: get you opening the app on reflex, then quietly stop being that cheap.\n\nYou're not the customer yet. You're the down payment.",
      "original_text": "Temu spends more to get you than it makes from you.\n\nFree shipping. Free returns. $0.80 phone cases. Ads during the Super Bowl.\n\nThat's customer acquisition cost, and right now theirs is higher than anything you'll ever spend there.\n\nThe bet is simple: get you opening the app on reflex, then quietly stop being that cheap.\n\nYou're not the customer yet. You're the down payment.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "Temu 为了获得你这个用户所花的钱，比从你身上赚到的还多。\n\n免运费。免费退货。$0.80 的手机壳。Super Bowl 期间投广告。\n\n这就是获客成本，而现在他们的获客成本比你以后在那上面花的任何钱都要高。\n\n这个赌注很简单：让你形成条件反射去打开 app，然后悄悄地不再那么便宜。\n\n你还不是客户。你是首付款。",
